      "body": "Hey guys! I noticed that the user can only maximize the asset window by clicking on the closed tab: \r\n\r\nhttps://user-images.githubusercontent.com/85491794/160863656-4ded1c6b-e0f6-4750-b52d-6bd35fe6b5bf.mp4\r\n\r\nAs you can see, if I minimize by clicking Visibility, I can only maximize by clicking Control (and vice versa). The user should be able to open the window by clicking on either tab (Visibility or Control).\r\n\r\n_Originally posted by @ShendMikullovci in https://github.com/serge-web/serge/issues/1452#issuecomment-1083238650_",
